# Ignoring common (extracted dir) and every fetched/packaged dependency archive
# helm dependency update produces under charts/, including local file:// subcharts
# it repackages there too (e.g. core-api-0.1.0.tgz, alongside the real charts/core-api/ source)
**/charts/common
**/charts/*.tgz
# Ignoring test directories
**/kitchen

# Ignore built JARs for JanusGraph
scripts/janusgraph/*.jar

# OpenTofu/Terraform local init artefacts (created by `tofu init`, e.g. when running the CI validate step locally)
**/.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
